# p_e4a7 — The Late Night, Revised: Guitar Home by 21, Blanket to Coffee Table at 21 (fork of p_c9d4)

The parent document predicted the guitar would still be on the coffee table or being played at 22:00, the blanket would still be on the couch at 22:00, and the snack bowl would be on the coffee table from 20:00 to 23:00. The evidence refutes all three: the guitar sits on bedroom_floor_b1 on 5 of 5 sighted days (the 22:00 coffee-table claim went against 4); the blanket is on coffee_table_l1 at 21:00 (×2) and 22:00 (×1), not on the couch (the 22:00 couch claim went against 1); and the snack bowl is on the counter at 18:00–19:00 and on the coffee table only at 21:00 (×2), not throughout 20:00–23:00 (the 20–23 claim went against 25 total, 12 since the last call).

What changed from the parent: (1) guitar_hana now goes ON_PERSON 19–21 and back to bedroom_floor_b1 by 21, removing the coffee-table staging block and the 21–23 ON_PERSON window; (2) blanket_shared moves from couch to coffee_table at 21; (3) snack_bowl_shared narrows its coffee-table window from 20–23 to 21–22 and adds a sink 0–6 overnight wash block. Hana's commute, Priya's routine, the plate and mug meal windows, and the remote's TV-stand base are all unchanged.

