What sets this apart: on a Saturday at 12:00 the vacuum is on floor_l_l1 (the weekday documents put it in storage at that hour); at 20:00 the remote is on coffee_table_l1 (the weekday documents put it at tv_stand_l1); at 18:00 the blanket is on armchair_l1 (the weekday documents put it on couch_l1). The p_e5f0 document captures the weekend brunch and guitar but says nothing about the vacuum, the remote's coffee-table position, or the armchair blanket.

